3/blog-post_75.html\" target=\"_blank\">『猜燈謎』台語按怎講？</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>主講／賴嘉仕<br /></span><span>記錄／吳玉祥<br /></span><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">用聲音搬演台語文學</a></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">——分享陳雷小說廣播劇</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">12</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">轉型正義kap不當黨產台語講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／吳俊瑩</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／張翠硯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/tuiekap.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tuì檔案看二二八ê國家暴力kap歷史真相</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>14</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">醫學台文</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">羅九安<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_83.html\" target=\"_blank\">論流行性感冒</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">16</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bóng講笑</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蘇鳳嬌<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_93.html\" target=\"_blank\">願望</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">19</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳泓宇<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_84.html\" target=\"_blank\">轉機</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">19</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來唸七字仔</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">楊忠憲<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_54.html\" target=\"_blank\">結婚講好話（二）</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">20</span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳錦月<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_63.html\" target=\"_blank\">過年炊粿</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>21</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林春香<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">溫暖ê副班長——許秀足</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡秋芬<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">竹松社區大學ê行讀——布袋戲</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>25</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吳婉鈴<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">度晬</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>26</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">施玉鳳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_2.html\" target=\"_blank\">花蓮台東行跤花</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>28</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">粼&nbsp; &nbsp; 粼<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/e_24.html\" target=\"_blank\">巷仔內ê風景</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鄭惠敏<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_43.html\" target=\"_blank\">過年</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">31</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃靜惠<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/blog-post_78.html\" target=\"_blank\">講古傳情（二）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張瀠文<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/03/huah-kape.html\" target=\"_blank\">Huah甘蔗</a></span></div><div><span style=